==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Only One Rarity}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Othom]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This can be cheesed similar to the likes of [[Performant Thunderclap]]. Save money until you have enough for Talented Awakened Bahamut, then send him out quickly followed by [[Green Shell Cat]] and [[Bullet Train Cat]]. This will kill the Angelic Gory and leave Bahamut attacking the base. When Chickful A comes, fire Breakerblast and you win.

